        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>教师观与学生观笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f2f2ee;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", \"SimSun\", cursive, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 560px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    background: #fbfbf8;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    padding: 15px 20px 30px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .torn-fragment {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 300px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: right;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n    border-left: 1px dashed #ccc;\n  }\n  .blue {\n    color: #2255aa;\n  }\n  .black {\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .indent1 { margin-left: 10px; }\n  .indent2 { margin-left: 25px; }\n  .indent3 { margin-left: 40px; }\n  .heading {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .annotation {\n    position: relative;\n    display: inline-block;\n    color: #2255aa;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-left: 60px;\n  }\n  .circle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #2255aa;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #2255aa;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 15px;\n    right: 15px;\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #777;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\n    transform: rotate(-25deg);\n  }\n  .underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- torn fragment of adjacent page visible at top-right / right edge -->\n  <div class=\"torn-fragment\">\n    <p>[illegible]</p>\n    <p>(以</p>\n    <p>(一般</p>\n    <p>&nbsp;</p>\n    <p>[illegible]</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"black heading\">4.教师观(教师观要求):</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">角色: 教师是学生学习的促进者.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">教育教学的研究者(反思性)</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">课程的开发者和建设者.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">开放有 无→有 建设有 有→优.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">社区型开放教师:</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">行为: 尊重.(对问题没有对话?坏) 赞赏(表扬)</p>\n\n  <p class=\"blue indent1\">帮助引导(为学生学习的促进者同意)</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">自我反思</p>\n\n  <span class=\"circle\">细心</span>\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">合作.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black heading\">点 学生观 △ 学生是发展中的人: ①学生的发展是有规律的</p>\n\n  <p class=\"blue indent1\">我们要按照学生的身心发展规律进行教育.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">②学生具有巨大的发展潜能的</p>\n\n  <p class=\"blue indent1\">我们要有信心,每个学生有发展有进步</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">③学生是发展过程中的人.(反复)</p>\n\n  <p class=\"blue indent1\">学生的身心发展尚未发展成熟,更允许存在反复</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">④学生的发展是全面的发展</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black heading\">△学生是独特的人: ①有机联的人→有情绪,思想</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">学生是完整的人</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">②与他人也→没有相同的相同性</p>\n\n  <p class=\"black indent1\">③与成人也→学生3同有巨大的差异</p>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: pen, bottom-right]</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
